meta {
  name: Get provider settings
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{URL}}/v1/admin/providers/:providername/settings
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  providername: openai
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
}

docs {
  Returns three things:

    network_config  what the dialer will actually use - every field filled,
                    stored override where set, gateway default everywhere else
    overrides       only what was explicitly stored for this provider
    proxy_config    the proxy, or null

  The split matters because zero is indistinguishable from unset. Without
  `overrides` a console cannot tell "inherited 60s" from "pinned to 60s", and a
  GET-then-PUT round trip would silently freeze every default as an override.

  Durations come back as nanoseconds: 60000000000 = 60s.

  Secrets are masked. Defaults come from the `upstream` block in server.yaml.
}
